<item><title>Chad court keeps two men in custody over alleged Boko Haram links</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-court-keeps-two-men-in-custody-over-alleged-boko-haram-c9373e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-court-keeps-two-men-in-custody-over-alleged-boko-haram-c9373e/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>The Tribunal de grande instance in N&apos;Djamena ordered both suspects held while investigators pursue further inquiries into their alleged ties to the group.</description><pubDate>Fri, 13 Nov 2026 08:30:18 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-court-keeps-two-men-in-custody-over-alleged-boko-haram-c9373e/share.jpg" length="43014" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-court-keeps-two-men-in-custody-over-alleged-boko-haram-c9373e/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
