<item><title>Chad to validate groundwater monitoring framework in N&apos;Djaména</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-to-validate-groundwater-monitoring-framework-in-n-c0a5e2/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/td/chad-to-validate-groundwater-monitoring-framework-in-n-c0a5e2/</guid><category>Chad</category><description>A two-day workshop in N&apos;Djaména, running 12 to 13 November, is set to approve a strategic framework for monitoring underground water.</description><pubDate>Thu, 12 Nov 2026 18:00:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" length="30806" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/td.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
